## 6. 循环结构


### 三种循环

```java
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
    System.out.println(i);
}

int i = 1;
while (i <= 5) {
    System.out.println(i);
    i++;
}

int j = 1;
do {
    System.out.println(j);
    j++;
} while (j <= 5);
```

### 示例：求 1 到 n 的和

```java
int sum = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {
    sum += i;
}
System.out.println(sum);
```

